","name":"kind/feature","color":"a2eeef","default":false,"description":"New feature or capability request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12834276080,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_PuC8A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/task/triage","name":"task/triage","color":"006b75","default":false,"description":"Queue packet kind: verify, reproduce, and route this item","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12834287735,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_Puwdw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/source/queue-worker","name":"source/queue-worker","color":"2da44e","default":false,"description":"Filed or worked by the queue/worker pilot","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12834291076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_Pu9hA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/priority/normal","name":"priority/normal","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":"Ordinary priority (the default)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12834295209,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_PvNqQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/meta/follow-up","name":"meta/follow-up","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":"Follow-up spun out of earlier work","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12834312156,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_PwP3A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/app/id","name":"app/id","color":"1d76db","default":false,"description":"Package/app: id (pkgs/ or apps/ in this repo)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12834738451,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_QKREw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/effort/m","name":"effort/m","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":"Medium: expected under 1 day of work","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12834770853,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAAC_QMPpQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/meta/enriched","name":"meta/enriched","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":"Intake review done: acceptance criteria, links, and normalized labels added","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":13050655170,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADCeExwg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/epic/id-program","name":"epic/id-program","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Reprioritization program epic (2026-11-12)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":28,"created_at":"2026-10-29T12:47:24Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:44:08Z","closed_at":"2026-11-23T03:44:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Follow-up from the currency control plane design (#2062), §4 of\n`doc/2026-10-29T12-42-21Z_design_currency_control_plane/`.\n\n## Scope\n\nThe gateway's signed request envelope and the pre-ledger write path.\n\n- Reuse the existing `pkgs/id` scheme: `directory_auth.rs` `Signed { key, at, nonce, signature }` over `id-request-v1\\n{method}\\n{target}\\n{at}\\n{nonce}\\nsha256(body)`, 5-minute window, `ReplayGuard`, **`verify_strict`** (never `verify`) (design §4.1, §4.6).\n- Per-op canonical CBOR bodies, domain-tagged (`id.currency.request.v1`), with strict decoding like `chain.rs`.\n- Device → **account** resolution before authorization; issuance binds to the account key (design §4.1b).\n- Deterministic idempotency-ID derivation and the typed-error surface (design §4.3).\n- Resolve the idempotency-ID vs TigerBeetle monotonic-ID guidance tension (design §9.3).\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A signed request round-trips: sign in a client, verify in the gateway, reject a tampered body, a stale `at`, and a replayed nonce.\n- A forgery fixture proves the gateway rejects a signature that only plain `verify` would accept.\n- Signature verification alone never authorizes: a valid signature from a non-minter is rejected.\n\n## Depends on\n\nNothing hard; F1/F2 for the end-to-end path.\n\nRefs #2062\n","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/2319/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/2319/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}